        }
      ],
      "extract": "In [@HatcherOertel], Hatcher and Oertel gave an algorithm for computing the boundary slopes of a Montesinos knot. At the end of their paper they provided a table giving the boundary slopes for each Montesinos knot in the standard table in Rolfsen's book [@Rolfsen76]. Unfortunately, their table contains several (17) errors. These errors were due to problems with the computer program that generated the table, as well",
      "extractCut": true
    },
