          "heading": false
        }
      ],
      "extract": "[]{#table label=\"table\"} Throughout this section ^\\*^ denotes an entry which differs from the corresponding entry in the table in [@HatcherOertel], and ^$\\dagger$^ denotes one that differs from the 1999 version of this note. Below are the boundary slopes for those Montesinos knots of ten or fewer crossings. Notation follows [@HatcherOertel] and [@Rolfsen76]. The program computes the Euler characteristic and number",
