      "extract": "[]{#method label=\"method\"} In this section I briefly describe the precautions taken to insure that the table in Section [\\[table\\]](#table){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"table\"} is correct. I first noticed errors in the table in [@HatcherOertel] when comparing it with the output of a program that computes the *normal* boundary slopes of a knot (that is, the boundary slopes of all surfaces which are normal with",
